In case of an operator or additional sensors, a slightly different PCB has to be drawn.
A fire detector, an intrusion detector, a timer etc... may be required.

However, the price of PCB is close to a constant for very low series.

This document explain how to slightly modify the PCB

The operator PCB does not require the disable function. The tip and trick is to reuse its electronics.
The disabled led is becoming the ring led.
* void R30
* replace R39 by a resistor of the same value than R32
* connect R39 pin 1 with R32 pin 1
* strap pin 14 with pin 1 of U5
* strap pin 1 of CONN_CHAIN with pin 1 of CONN_DISABLE
* strap pin 3 of U3 with pin 8 of U10, while keeping the pins out of the PCB
* change R40 from 22.1R to 10K
